      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalolosuku abaseGibithe bazakuba buthakathaka njengabesifazana; bazathuthumela besabe lapho bebona isandla iNkosi yamabandla eselulela ukubatshaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilizwe lakoJuda lizakwesabeka kwabaseGibithe. Bonke abaseGibithe bekuzwa lokhu bazathuthumela ngenxa yecebo iNkosi yamabandla elimisileyo mayelana labo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalolosuku kuzakuba khona imizi emihlanu elizweni laseGibithe ekhuluma ulimi lwesiHebheru, lethembekileyo eNkosini yamabandla. Omunye wayo uzakuthiwa nguMuzi weLanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalolosuku kuzakuba khona ialtare leNkosi phakathi kwelizwe laseGibithe, lensika yokukhonzela iNkosi emkhawulweni walo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izakuba yisibonakaliso sokuba khona kweNkosi yamabandla elizweni laseGibithe. Lapho bekhala eNkosini ngenxa yabacindezeli, izakubathumela umkhululi ozabavikela, abakhulule. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi izakuziveza kwabaseGibithe; bona bazakuyazi ngalesosikhathi, bayikhonze ngemihlatshelo langeminikelo yokutshiswa, benze izifungo zabo kuyo, bazigcwalise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi izakulitshaya iGibithe, ilitshaye ibuye ilisilise; bazaphendukela kuyo, yona izakuzwa imikhuleko yabo, ibasilise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalolosuku kuzakuba khona umgwaqo osuka eGibithe usiya eAsiriya; abaseAsiriya bazakuza eGibithe, labaseGibithe baye eAsiriya, bakhonze ndawonye labaseAsiriya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalolosuku uIsrayeli uzakuba ngowesithathu kanye leGibithe leAsiriya, babe yisibusiso phakathi komhlaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yamabandla izakubabusisa ithi: Ibusisiwe iGibithe abantu bami, leAsiriya umsebenzi wezandla zami, loIsrayeli abantu bami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
